{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1793021697","published":"2026-10-26T13:36:12Z","modified":"2026-11-27T16:30:17.750166415Z","upstream":["CVE-2025-15366","CVE-2025-15367"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2025-15366, CVE-2025-15367","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: Command injection in imaplib\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-15366.patch: in Lib/imaplib.py, reject NUL,\n       CR and LF in IMAP command arguments with ValueError. Backport of\n       upstream 6262704b134d (gh-143921) combined with its narrowing\n       d0921efb665a (GH-153067), as in the upstream 3.13 backport: only\n       those three characters are rejected, so other control characters\n       that may occur in server-returned mailbox names keep working, which\n       avoids the regression that made Debian revert the original fix in\n       3.9.2-1+deb11u6\n     - CVE-2025-15366\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: Command injection in poplib\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2025-15367.patch: in Lib/poplib.py, reject C0\n       control characters and DEL in POP3 commands with ValueError.\n       Backport of upstream b234a2b67539 (gh-143923)\n     - CVE-2025-15367","affected":[{"package":{"name":"idle-python3.9","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/idle-python3.9?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.9.2-1+deb11u7+tuxcare.els6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1793021697.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython3.9","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython3.9?distro=debian-11"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"3.9.2-1+deb11u7+tuxcare.els6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/debian11els/CLSA-2026-1793021697.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libpython3.9-dev","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Debian:11","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libpython3.9-dev?distro=debian-11"},"r